flowchart LR
  subgraph browser["Trust boundary: browser"]
    U[User] --> UI[React routes and components]
    UI --> AUTH[AuthContext: persisted JWT and expiry]
    UI --> API[services/api.js]
    LS[(localStorage: JWT and API origin)] --> API
    AUTH <-->|persist and restore JWT| LS
  end
  subgraph server["Trust boundary: FastAPI backend"]
    HTTP[FastAPI routing and middleware] --> JWT[HS256 bearer validation]
    HTTP --> LOGIN[Environment-configured login]
    JWT --> CHAT[ChatService]
    JWT --> READ[AssessmentService]
    CHAT --> FLOW[Sequential chat_workflow]
    FLOW --> CLOUD[CloudAgent: tool selection]
    FLOW --> RAG[RagService]
    FLOW --> COMP[ComplianceAgent]
    FLOW --> SENIOR[SeniorAgent]
    CHAT --> REPO[AssessmentRepository]
    READ --> REPO
    REPO --> DB[(SQLAlchemy: SQLite default)]
    CLOUD --> TOOLS[Allowlisted read-only AWSAuditor]
    TOOLS --> BOTO[Boto3 credential chain]
    RAG --> EMB[CPU embedding model]
    RAG --> FAISS[(FAISS index)]
    RAG --> PKL[(Trusted-local framework metadata pickle)]
  end
  API -->|"HTTPS recommended; password at login, then JWT and prompts"| HTTP
  CLOUD -->|"prompt and tool schema"| LLM[Configured OpenAI-compatible NVIDIA model endpoint]
  COMP -->|"audit evidence and retrieved guidance"| LLM
  SENIOR -->|"audit evidence and compliance text"| LLM
  BOTO -->|"signed read-only API requests"| AWS[AWS APIs]
  AWS -->|"resource evidence or service errors"| TOOLS
  EMB -.->|"first-load model download if uncached"| HF[Model distribution]
